  <item>
    <title>2024人生复盘|有在好好生活就很棒啦</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67a7068dd74435e4a3d6b801</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67a7068dd74435e4a3d6b801</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 08 Feb 2025 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2024年年初信誓旦旦，有计划A有计划BC，当真正开始做的时候才发现其实总会被琐事绊住，很快2025年就来了，没复盘的时候感觉自己浑浑噩噩，稍微一梳理，才发现其实这一年是有新的成长的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次的播客有点久，我们俩很随意地在闲聊复盘，感谢关注和在听的朋友，新年快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>做了新的开头，希望大家喜欢~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgFGU-uRpHn9jAUlI9uv5Z4WEzIT.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a>23年定下的目标，24年有完成吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1352">22:32</a>24年最大的变化是什么呢？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a>咱以食为天，今年最爱的食物是什么捏！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2310">38:30</a> 24年最爱用的表情包是什么？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl2YS3tSZQBbCSLikDuTbZpyc5kj.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a>今年开心的事情</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 今年难过的事情</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a> 今年做的最重要的决定</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4440">01:14:00</a> 一些我们的碎碎念</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4532">01:15:32</a> 一个小彩蛋&nbsp;</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>开头bgm：《海女 あまちやん 》《老友记》《瞬息全宇宙 Everything Everywhere All at Once》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk2xrMbBxjtrTUaw9kj251dNRU2L.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft2JHOivk8GQgq7U5WvfUIGthiZ-.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsyt-Y5Oel0sVQXLa7Jpc-OFsdXG.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>结尾bgm：《电子情书 You've Got Mail》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiGgKa0BT7uCo-9IN4jCNvCTOdue.png"></figure>]]></description>
