  <item>
    <title>活點地圖 | 从外卖到带饭，今年更了解自己的口味了！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c0294333591c27beb310c9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c0294333591c27beb310c9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Aug 2024 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今年我们俩都选择了自己做饭，自己带饭。</span></p><span></span><p><span>开始做这件事情之后，才发现，</span></p><span></span><p><span>其实很多时候做饭并没有想象中的这么麻烦这么困难。&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于本期我们会谈论：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 开始自己做饭的契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 空气炸锅美食！原来可以这么省事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 登登的菜谱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 给自己做预制菜？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 开始给自己带饭！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2190">36:30</a> 我们俩的参考！</span></p><span></span><p><span>登登的推荐：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/274336320?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/274336320?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0"><span>MASA料理ABC</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/479400105?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/479400105?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0"><span>主厨Paolo</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/1601815574?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/1601815574?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0"><span>孤独的美食家阿部</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkvpGWKvLkYxA9ofX02PaZGBMBVw.png"></figure><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5edf0e47418a84a046f44a5e" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5edf0e47418a84a046f44a5e"><span>津津有味</span></a><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;超级棒的一个播客，我们俩都很喜欢！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>kiki的推荐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小火锅底料：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqIZfLjT08KoUiA9LV2CgOZpF9uG.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/5957440?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/5957440?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0"><span>曼食慢语</span></a><span>/</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/8960728?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/8960728?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0"><span>日食记</span></a><span>——什么都做一点，画面治愈</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/18531444?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/18531444?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0"><span>饲养员小绵羊</span></a><span> ——打工人友好！！电饭锅做饭的神</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/510028707?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/510028707?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0"><span>河大基础医学院丁勇</span></a><span>——健康的饮食方式（合集·各年龄段的营养要求、合集·维生素相关知识、合集·营养与健康）</span></p>]]></description>
