    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>/*主播*/ 大仑丁</span></p><span></span><p><span>/*嘉宾*/ 登登登蹬噔</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听《</span><a href="[https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6484a2a8e68894365ddb53d4]" data-url="[https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6484a2a8e68894365ddb53d4]"><span>仑流发言</span></a><span>》和《</span><a href="[https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/643a64a79361a4e7c39b588f]" data-url="[https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/643a64a79361a4e7c39b588f]"><span>活點地圖</span></a><span>》的联名节目！在本期节目中，厉害的咖啡师登登登蹬噔和大仑丁在松弛愉快的氛围里聊起了关于咖啡的二三事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>/*本期节目您将听到*/</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">00:01:21</a> 咖啡师不仅仅是站在店里的NPC</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1088">00:18:08</a> 繁杂的咖啡店工作流程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1533">00:25:33</a> 风味与风味轮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2273">00:37:53</a> 瑕疵咖啡的奇怪味道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2659">00:44:19</a> 发酵与烘焙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3428">00:57:08</a> 如何成为咖啡师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3935">01:05:35</a> 金杯并非一成不变的标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4387">01:13:07</a> 咖啡师也有职业病</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4898">01:21:38</a> ED: beabadoobee - Coffee</span></p><span></span><p><span>/*咖啡风味轮*/</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgAddD_3Cn4rSrOxuUvMLA6kXzze.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>/*金杯标准图*/</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuM-mW6McgWfk8HWvY1huLK83FD7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>/*本节目由开源软件Audacity剪辑制作*/</span></p>]]></description>
