    <pubDate>Thu, 03 Aug 2023 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嘿嘿！第五期啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期是跟上一期一起录的。这次录音意外地顺利！聊到开始运动之后的变化，我们都深有感触。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:14</a>深圳有啥好玩的运动？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="279">04:39</a>沿海城市的海上运动很丰富，但是太晒了我俩也没咋去QAQ&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="293">04:53</a>登登的棒球馆体验&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="447">07:27</a>下决心运动的契机</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="554">09:14</a>办健身卡要慎重，沉默成本需注意</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="911">15:11</a>运动真的快乐，养成习惯后真的戒不掉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 把健身安排在工作日更容易坚持！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1061">17:41</a>把To do lists 一条条完成，真的非常让人骄傲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1277">21:17</a>运动给我更强的人生掌控感&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1506">25:06</a>选择自己想要的生活方式，而不是被选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1749">29:09</a>“你的肌肉不会背叛你”！&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
